<ServiceLayout title="Scoliosis" description="Chiropractic care for scoliosis at Frey Clinic of Chiropractic in Napoleon, OH." schemaType="MedicalCondition">
<p>Scoliosis is a lateral curvature of the spine that can range from mild to severe. While chiropractic care cannot cure scoliosis, it can help manage symptoms, improve mobility, and slow progression in many cases.</p>
<hr class="rule rule--accent" style="margin-block:var(--sp-6);" />
<h2>How chiropractic helps with scoliosis</h2>
<p>Regular chiropractic adjustments can help maintain flexibility in the spine, reduce pain associated with the curvature, and improve overall posture and function. For growing children, early detection and management are particularly important. Our chiropractors can monitor your child's spinal development and provide gentle care tailored to their needs.</p>
</ServiceLayout>
